@host = http://localhost:5165
@contentType = application/json

### 1) LOGIN
POST {{host}}/api/v1/Account/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
{
  "userName": "AdminUser",
  "password": "123Pa$$word!"
}

### 2) Pega aquí el jwt 
@token = {{loginRequest.response.body.$.jwt}}

### COMMERCE — Crear
### Caso feliz: debe dar 201 Created
POST {{host}}/api/v1/Admin/commerce
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
{
  "name": "Tienda Demo8",
  "description": "Comercio de prueba intento numero 11?",
  "rnc": "234106789",
  "email": "conta109@tiendademo.com",
  "phoneNumber": "8094441009",
  "logo": "logo-demo.png"
}

### Guarda el id que te devolvió el POST de arriba para los siguientes bloques
@commerceId = 7

### Caso de error esperado: RNC con menos de 9 dígitos -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{host}}/api/v1/Admin/commerce
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
{
  "name": "Comercio RNC Inválido",
  "description": "Debe fallar",
  "rnc": "12345",
  "email": "invalido@demo.com",
  "phoneNumber": "8095551234",
  "logo": "logo.png"
}

### Caso de error esperado: correo con formato inválido -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{host}}/api/v1/Admin/commerce
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
{
  "name": "Comercio Email Inválido",
  "description": "Debe fallar",
  "rnc": "987654321",
  "email": "esto-no-es-un-correo",
  "phoneNumber": "8095551234",
  "logo": "logo.png"
}

### Caso de error esperado: RNC duplicado (repite el mismo del primer POST) -> 409 Conflict
### Este SÍ debe venir en formato ApiProblem ("title": "Comercio duplicado", ...)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/Admin/commerce
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
{
  "name": "Tienda Demo Duplicada",
  "description": "Mismo RNC que la primera",
  "rnc": "123456789",
  "email": "otro-correo@demo.com",
  "phoneNumber": "8095551234",
  "logo": "logo.png"
}

### Caso de error esperado: correo duplicado (mismo email del primer POST, RNC distinto) -> 409 Conflict
POST {{host}}/api/v1/Admin/commerce
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
{
  "name": "Tienda Demo Email Duplicado",
  "description": "Mismo correo que la primera",
  "rnc": "111222333",
  "email": "contacto@tiendademo.com",
  "phoneNumber": "8095551234",
  "logo": "logo.png"
}
### COMMERCE — Listar
### Listado por defecto (activos, page=1, pageSize=20)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/Admin/commerce
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filtrado por estado inactivo
GET {{host}}/api/v1/Admin/commerce?page=1&pageSize=20&status=inactivo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
### Filtrado por estado
GET {{host}}/api/v1/Admin/commerce?page=1&pageSize=20&status=todos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
### Caso de error esperado: page en 0 -> 400 Bad Request
GET {{host}}/api/v1/Admin/commerce?page=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Caso de error esperado: pageSize mayor a 20 -> 400 Bad Request
GET {{host}}/api/v1/Admin/commerce?pageSize=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### COMMERCE — Consultar por Id
### Debe existir (usa el {{commerceId}} guardado arriba)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/Admin/commerce/{{commerceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Caso de error esperado: id inexistente -> 404 Not Found
GET {{host}}/api/v1/Admin/commerce/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### COMMERCE — Actualizar
### Actualización válida -> 204 No Content
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/Admin/commerce/{{commerceId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
{
  "name": "Tienda Demo Actualizada",
  "description": "Descripción actualizada",
  "rnc": "123456789",
  "email": "contacto.actualizado@tiendademo.com",
  "phoneNumber": "8095555678",
  "logo": "logo-demo-v2.png"
}

### Caso de error esperado: id inexistente -> 404 Not Found
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/Admin/commerce/999999
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
{
  "name": "No existe",
  "description": "",
  "rnc": "555555555",
  "email": "noexiste@demo.com",
  "phoneNumber": "8095551234",
  "logo": "logo.png"
}

### COMMERCE — Cambiar estado (con cascada de usuarios asociados)
### Desactivar -> 204 No Content. Si el comercio tiene un usuario Comercio
### asociado y activo, revisa en Supabase que haya quedado IsActive=false.
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/Admin/commerce/{{commerceId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
{ "status": false }

### Reactivar -> 204 No Content. El usuario asociado NO debe reactivarse solo.
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/Admin/commerce/{{commerceId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
{ "status": true }

### Caso de error esperado: id inexistente -> 404 Not Found
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/Admin/commerce/999999/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
{ "status": false }

### SEGURIDAD
### Sin token -> 401 Unauthorized
GET {{host}}/api/v1/Admin/commerce

### Token corrupto (le quito el último carácter a propósito) -> 401 Unauthorized
GET {{host}}/api/v1/Admin/commerce
Authorization: Bearer 1f4XSa{{token}}